    <header class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">01A · 专题 · non-overlap / overlap</p>
      <h1>两种模式都执行隔离事务；差别是跨轮值存在哪里、何时解析，以及异步引用要保活多久</h1>
      <p class="lead">不要把 <code>resolve_forward_inputs()</code> 的“被调用”误读为“一定修改 batch”。non-overlap 的纯 dSpark decode 会穿过这个函数但命中 no-op；overlap 才从 <code>FutureMap</code> 取回上一轮长度、bonus 与附加字段。</p>
      <div class="evidence-strip"><span><strong>共同不变量</strong> 都是 restore 后才安装下一轮 <code>DFlashDraftInputV2</code></span><span><strong>关键差异</strong> non-overlap 直接提交；overlap 通过 pool-indexed buffer relay</span><span><strong>证据边界</strong> f01a0c7f97ec · CUDA dSpark V2 · 静态核验</span></div>
      <div class="route-switch" aria-label="保留站点讲解路线"><button type="button" data-route-choice="static-greedy">STATIC · 贪心</button><button type="button" data-route-choice="compact-sampling">COMPACT · 随机采样</button><button type="button" data-route-choice="folded-greedy">FOLDED · 贪心</button></div>
      <div data-semantic-legend></div>
    </header>

    <section class="handoff" aria-label="时间线交接契约">
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>上一轮产物</b><span><code>new_seq_lens</code>、bonus 与可选 Draft 附加字段</span></div>
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>本页问题</b><span>这些值何时写、存在哪里、下一轮何时进入 <code>ScheduleBatch</code></span></div>
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>共同结果</b><span>worker 仍收到正确的 anchor/长度，隔离区外仍恢复 Scheduler 模式</span></div>
      <div class="handoff__item"><b>下一消费者</b><span><code>DSparkWorkerV2._forward_decode()</code> 或 Prefill bootstrap</span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="aligned-timeline">
      <div class="section__head"><p class="section__kicker">主视图 · 两条对齐泳道</p><h2>沿同一轮时间轴比较，而不是把两个实现拆成互不相干的流程</h2><p class="section__intro">紫色表示设备 stream/event 或异步生命周期；蓝色表示 buffer/object 数据。三条 STATIC/COMPACT/FOLDED 路线共享这层 Scheduler 机制。</p></div>
      <div class="visual stepper" data-stepper data-steps="9">
        <div class="visual__bar"><strong>一轮 N 的执行 + 一轮 N+1 的解析</strong><button class="zoom-button" type="button" data-zoom-target="#compare-board">放大主图</button></div>
        <div class="visual__body">
          <div class="stepper__toolbar"><div class="stepper__buttons"><button type="button" data-step-action="prev">上一步</button><button type="button" data-step-action="next">下一步</button><button type="button" data-step-action="play">播放</button><button type="button" data-step-action="reset">重置</button></div><div class="stepper__progress" aria-hidden="true"><span data-step-progress></span></div><div class="stepper__status" data-step-status aria-live="polite"></div></div>
          <div class="step-copyline" aria-live="polite"><div data-step-copy="0"><b>第 1 步</b> 两边进入同一个 <code>Scheduler.run_batch(batch_to_run)</code>，但 overlap 的 batch 携带上一轮 <code>future_indices</code>。</div><div data-step-copy="1"><b>第 2 步</b> non-overlap resolver 是 guard-only no-op；overlap 先解析长度，再在 forward stream 中解析 bonus/附加字段。</div><div data-step-copy="2"><b>第 3 步</b> 两边都做全字段 snapshot；只有 overlap 把 batch 与 snapshot 压入两槽引用环。</div><div data-step-copy="3"><b>第 4 步</b> 两边都进入同一个 <code>DSparkWorkerV2</code>，只有 overlap 额外传入 <code>on_publish</code>。</div><div data-step-copy="4"><b>第 5 步</b> overlap 在 worker 中途 publish 新长度并记录 event；non-overlap 只把新长度留在结果对象。</div><div data-step-copy="5"><b>第 6 步</b> overlap 在 isolation 内把 bonus/附加字段 stash 到 FutureMap，并追加 worker 要求保活的 tensor 引用。</div><div data-step-copy="6"><b>第 7 步</b> 两边都执行 finally restore；临时 Target Verify 视图都不会跨轮。</div><div data-step-copy="7"><b>第 8 步</b> non-overlap 直接写回 seq/spec；overlap 先持有 <code>next_draft_input</code>，再写 <code>future_indices</code> 把下一轮解析绑定到 FutureMap。</div><div data-step-copy="8"><b>第 9 步</b> N+1 轮 overlap 通过 event/stream 关系，以 FutureMap 的权威槽位覆盖/物化长度与 bonus，完成闭环。</div></div>
          <div class="swim-scroll" id="compare-board"><div class="compare-board" role="table" aria-label="non-overlap 和 overlap 对齐时间线">
            <div class="compare-head" role="row"><div class="compare-head__corner">轮次 / 阶段</div><div><b>non-overlap · 同步路径</b><span><code>Scheduler.run_batch()</code> 返回前完成 worker、D2H 与跨轮字段写回。</span></div><div><b>overlap · forward stream 路径</b><span>schedule stream 准备下一轮；forward/copy stream 与 <code>FutureMap</code> relay 当前结果。</span></div></div>
            <div class="compare-row" data-step-node="0"><div class="compare-row__time">N · 入口</div><div class="compare-cell"><div class="timeline-event" data-kind="data"><b>batch 持有真实当前状态</b><code>spec_info.bonus_tokens=X</code><br><code>seq_lens=[20]</code></div></div><div class="compare-cell"><div class="timeline-event" data-kind="data"><b>batch 持有 relay 索引</b><code>spec_info.future_indices=fi</code>；真实长度/bonus 位于上一轮写入的 buffer。</div></div></div>
            <div class="compare-row" data-step-node="1"><div class="compare-row__time">N · resolve</div><div class="compare-cell"><div class="timeline-event" data-kind="off"><b>resolve_forward_inputs() 被调用但 no-op</b>纯 spec decode：无 prefill staging；<code>spec_algo.is_none()==False</code>；<code>enable_overlap=False</code>。</div></div><div class="compare-cell"><div class="timeline-event" data-kind="cuda"><b>resolve_seq_lens_cpu() → wait_stream → resolve_forward_inputs()</b>先用 <code>fi</code> gather <code>new_seq_lens_buf</code>，再由 <code>_resolve_spec_extras()</code> gather bonus/附加字段。</div></div></div>
            <div class="compare-row" data-step-node="2"><div class="compare-row__time">N · snapshot</div><div class="compare-cell"><div class="timeline-event" data-kind="guard"><b>_forward_isolation(overlap=False)</b>全字段快照 + sampling copy；同步路径不分配 <code>batch_record_buf</code>。</div></div><div class="compare-cell"><div class="timeline-event" data-kind="cuda"><b>_forward_isolation(overlap=True)</b>sampling copy 后调用 <code>record_batch_in_overlap()</code>，把 <code>[batch, attr_snapshot]</code> 放入两槽环。</div></div></div>
            <div class="compare-row" data-step-node="3"><div class="compare-row__time">N · worker</div><div class="compare-cell"><div class="timeline-event"><b>DSparkWorkerV2.forward_batch_generation(batch)</b><code>on_publish=None</code></div></div><div class="compare-cell"><div class="timeline-event" data-kind="cuda"><b>DSparkWorkerV2.forward_batch_generation(batch,on_publish=…)</b><code>on_publish=partial(future_map.publish, fi)</code></div></div></div>
            <div class="compare-row" data-step-node="4"><div class="compare-row__time">N · 长度就绪</div><div class="compare-cell"><div class="timeline-event" data-kind="data"><b>只写结果对象</b><code>batch_result.new_seq_lens=[22]</code>；稍后由 Scheduler 直接提交。</div></div><div class="compare-cell"><div class="timeline-event" data-kind="cuda"><b>FutureMap.publish(fi,[22],confidence?)</b>scatter 到 <code>new_seq_lens_buf</code>，记录/重链 <code>publish_ready</code> event；decode 中发生在 accept 后、<code>commit_hidden()</code> 前。</div></div></div>
            <div class="compare-row" data-step-node="5"><div class="compare-row__time">N · payload</div><div class="compare-cell"><div class="timeline-event" data-kind="off"><b>没有 FutureMap relay</b>bonus 与新 Draft 状态保留在 <code>batch_result.next_draft_input</code>。</div></div><div class="compare-cell"><div class="timeline-event" data-kind="cuda"><b>_relay_forward_payload() → FutureMap.stash()</b>把 bonus/可选 hidden/top-k/draft_probs 写 pool-indexed buffer；<code>extra_keep_alive_refs</code> 追加到同一引用环槽。</div></div></div>
            <div class="compare-row" data-step-node="6"><div class="compare-row__time">N · restore</div><div class="compare-cell"><div class="timeline-event" data-kind="guard"><b>finally 恢复 batch</b>恢复进入 isolation 时的 Scheduler 视图。</div></div><div class="compare-cell"><div class="timeline-event" data-kind="guard"><b>finally 恢复 batch</b>同样恢复；两槽引用环仍保留被 GPU 异步工作引用的对象。</div></div></div>
            <div class="compare-row" data-step-node="7"><div class="compare-row__time">N · 提交下一轮引用</div><div class="compare-cell"><div class="timeline-event" data-kind="data"><b>直接提交真实值</b><code>batch.spec_info=next_draft_input(Y)</code><br><code>batch.seq_lens=[22]</code><br><code>batch.input_ids=None</code></div></div><div class="compare-cell"><div class="timeline-event" data-kind="data"><b>持有 next_draft_input + 绑定索引</b><code>batch.spec_info=next_draft_input</code> 已带本轮 bonus/extras tensor，再写 <code>future_indices=fi</code>；下一轮实际消费前由 resolver 以 FutureMap 槽位覆盖/物化权威值。长度不在此处直接写回。</div></div></div>
            <div class="compare-row" data-step-node="8"><div class="compare-row__time">N+1 · resolve</div><div class="compare-cell"><div class="timeline-event"><b>直接读取持久字段</b>下一轮 Draft 已看到 <code>Y/[22]</code>；resolver 仍可被调用但纯 decode no-op。</div></div><div class="compare-cell"><div class="timeline-event" data-kind="cuda"><b>FutureMap 完成跨轮闭环</b><code>resolve_seq_lens_cpu()</code> 等待 publish event；<code>_resolve_spec_extras()</code> 用 <code>fi</code> 填入 bonus/附加字段，再进入下一次 isolation。</div></div></div>
          </div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="lifetime">
      <div class="section__head"><p class="section__kicker">辅助视图 · FutureMap 与引用保活</p><h2>值的 relay 与 tensor 的 lifetime 是两套互补机制</h2><p class="section__intro"><code>FutureMap</code> 保存下一轮要读取的值；<code>batch_record_buf</code> 保存仍可能被设备工作引用的 Python/tensor 对象。前者不能替代后者。</p></div>
      <div class="visual"><div class="visual__bar"><strong>publish / stash / resolve + 两轮引用环</strong><button class="zoom-button" type="button" data-zoom-target="#lifetime-loop">放大辅图</button></div><div class="visual__body canvas-scroll"><div class="object-loop" id="lifetime-loop">
        <article class="object-node" data-kind="main"><b>N · accept/finalize</b><span><code>new_seq_lens=[22]</code><br><code>next_draft_input.bonus=Y</code></span></article>
        <article class="object-node" data-kind="cuda"><b>FutureMap.publish()</b><span>长度 → <code>new_seq_lens_buf[fi]</code><br>event → <code>publish_ready</code></span><div class="buffer-cells"><div class="buffer-cell">fi:22</div><div class="buffer-cell">event N</div></div></article>
        <article class="object-node" data-kind="data"><b>FutureMap.stash()</b><span>bonus Y → <code>output_tokens_buf[fi]</code><br>可选 Draft extras → 对应 buffer</span><div class="buffer-cells"><div class="buffer-cell">fi:Y</div><div class="buffer-cell">extras</div></div></article>
        <article class="object-node" data-kind="guard"><b>batch_record_buf[N mod 2]</b><span><code>[batch, attr_snapshot, ...extra_keep_alive_refs]</code><br>两轮环避免 Python GC / caching allocator 过早复用。</span></article>
        <article class="object-node" data-kind="cuda"><b>N+1 · wait / gather</b><span><code>resolve_seq_lens_cpu()</code><br><code>resolve_forward_inputs()</code><br>按 <code>future_indices</code> 取值。</span></article>
        <article class="object-node" data-kind="main"><b>N+1 · worker 输入</b><span><code>batch.seq_lens=[22]</code><br><code>draft_input.bonus_tokens=[Y]</code><br>再次进入隔离事务。</span></article>
      </div></div></div>
      <div class="branch-note"><strong>Prefill 边界：</strong>overlap prefill 没有 accept/finalize；Target forward/sample 写出 <code>new_seq_lens</code> 后立即 <code>on_publish()</code>，再检查 FULL hidden、注入 Draft KV 并构造首个 <code>DFlashDraftInputV2</code>。这条启动桥接在 02 展开。</div>
      <div class="callouts" style="margin-top:18px"><article class="callout" data-kind="fail"><b>省略 record_batch_in_overlap()</b><p>异步 forward/copy 仍可能引用 snapshot 中的 GPU tensor，但 Python 引用已离开局部作用域；对象可能被 GC、底层存储可能被 caching allocator 复用，属于生命周期正确性风险。</p></article><article class="callout" data-kind="fail"><b>把 resolver 放回 isolation 内</b><p>snapshot 会记录“staging 尚未消费”的旧视图；finally 可能把 <code>prefill_input_ids_cpu/mix_running_indices</code> 恢复回来，造成下一轮重复消费。当前源码特意先 resolve，再 snapshot。</p></article></div>
      <details class="source-details"><summary>源码锚点与边界</summary><div class="source-details__body">
        <div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/managers/overlap_utils.py:84–116</code><span><code>resolve_forward_inputs()</code> 的三组 guard；non-overlap spec V2 不解析 relay extras，纯 decode 通常不改字段。</span></div>
        <div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/managers/scheduler.py:3310–3367</code><span><code>record_batch_in_overlap()</code> 保存全字段引用；<code>_forward_isolation()</code> 只在 overlap 路径写两槽引用环。</span></div>
        <div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/managers/scheduler.py:3398–3494</code><span>overlap 顺序：resolve 长度 → wait stream → resolve extras → isolation → worker/on_publish → relay/copy → restore → 安装带索引的 next draft input。</span></div>
        <div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/managers/overlap_utils.py:363–521</code><span><code>_resolve_spec_extras()</code>、<code>resolve_seq_lens_cpu()</code>、<code>publish()</code> 与 <code>stash()</code> 的 buffer/event 边界。</span></div>
        <div class="source-anchor"><code>python/sglang/srt/managers/scheduler.py:3608–3621</code><span><code>_relay_forward_payload()</code> 将 <code>next_draft_input</code> 转成 <code>RelayPayload</code> 后交给 <code>FutureMap.stash()</code>。</span></div>
      </div></details>
    </section>
